---@field export_filter_id? string|distilled.Null ID of the BGP filter profile applied to routes advertised to the customer.
---@field extra_prefixes? cloudflare.magic_transit.IpsecTunnelsUpdateResponseModifiedIpsecTunnelBgpExtraPrefixesList|distilled.Null Prefixes in this list will be advertised to the customer device, in addition to the routes in the Magic routing table. Each entry must be a network address in CIDR notation with no host bits set (for example `192.0.2.0/24`, not `192.0.2.1/24`) and must not repeat another entry. IPv6 prefixes are accepted only when the tunnel has an `interface_address6`.
